/* transit-text.js — classic script; assigns to window.TD. No ES modules, so file:// works.
   The personal-horoscope texts: each moving planet (Sun to Pluto) touching each natal point (Sun to Saturn,
   Ascendant, Midheaven) as conjunction, easy (trine/sextile) or hard (square/opposition) contact
   (transit:Moving:Natal:kind), the Moon and the Sun through each natal house (moonhouse:N, sunhouse:N) and each
   planet's retrograde period (retro:Planet). 275 texts. Written fresh for this demo; a live site edits
   or replaces them. Loaded only when the horoscope page needs it. */
window.TD = window.TD || {};
window.TD.TRANSIT_TEXT = {"transit:Sun:Sun:conjunction":"A small personal new year arrives for about two days. Your energy and sense of direction feel clearer than usual, so choose the one thing that matters most to you and give it a real hour. Say no to a favor you would resent. Keep plans simple, because the lift is brief.",
"transit:Sun:Sun:easy":"Two days of smooth footing. You feel more like yourself and others tend to respond well to that, so this is a good moment to speak up in a meeting, share an idea, or show a project you have been holding back. Use the ease on purpose, then let it go.",
"transit:Sun:Sun:hard":"For a couple of days your own wishes bump against what the day demands. You may feel tired, stubborn, or pulled between a duty and a want. Do the must-do first, then protect one small hour that is only yours. Skip big arguments about who you are.",
"transit:Sun:Moon:conjunction":"Head and heart line up for about two days. You know what you want and what you need, which is rarer than it sounds. Cook the comforting meal, call the person who feels like home, or tidy your space. Feelings run close to the surface, so be gentle with yourself.",
"transit:Sun:Moon:easy":"Inner mood and outer plans cooperate for two days. You can read your own feelings clearly and say them kindly. Have the warm conversation with someone close, or arrange your space so it supports you. A short walk at the end of the day helps the good mood settle.",
"transit:Sun:Moon:hard":"What you want to do and what you feel like doing pull apart for a couple of days. Moods may be touchy, and small remarks can sting more than intended. Name the feeling before you act on it, and put off any family or household decision until the mood passes.",
"transit:Sun:Mercury:conjunction":"Your mind and your sense of self meet for two days, so thinking feels personal and sharp. It is a good time to write the message that says exactly what you mean, or to make a plan on paper. Just avoid arguing a point only to win it.",
"transit:Sun:Mercury:easy":"Ideas come easily and words arrive in the right order for two days. Use that. Answer the pile of messages, draft the outline, ask the question you have been rehearsing. A quick phone call will get more done than a long thread. Say it simply.",
"transit:Sun:Mercury:hard":"For two days your thinking and your identity rub against each other, and you may talk before you have settled what you mean. Read things twice, and wait an hour before sending anything sharp. Write your points down first. Clarity comes once you stop trying to be right.",
"transit:Sun:Venus:conjunction":"Warmth, taste and affection get extra light for about two days. You enjoy people more and they enjoy you. Make a plan with someone you like, pick up flowers or a good coffee, or fix one thing at home that annoys the eye. Keep spending modest and pleasures simple.",
"transit:Sun:Venus:easy":"An easy, sociable stretch of two days. You can be charming without effort, so ask for what you want kindly, or reconnect with a friend. A shared meal, a compliment said out loud, or tidying a shared space all land well. Enjoy it without turning it into a test.",
"transit:Sun:Venus:hard":"For two days your sense of self and your wish to please pull in different directions. You may feel overlooked, or be tempted to treat yourself too much. Notice what you are really hungry for. Say one honest thing to someone you love and hold off on any impulse purchase.",
"transit:Sun:Mars:conjunction":"Drive and identity are fused for about two days, so you have more push than usual and less patience. Spend it on something physical or stubborn: a hard workout, a messy chore, a task you keep dodging. If you feel irritable, take a brisk walk before replying to anyone.",
"transit:Sun:Mars:easy":"Energy and confidence work together for two days. You can start the thing you have been circling, and finish it. Pick a task that takes courage but not a fight, such as making the phone call, starting the project, or asking for the meeting. Move early in the day.",
"transit:Sun:Mars:hard":"Short fuse, strong will, two days. You may feel competitive, or find that small delays make you bristle. Channel it into exercise or a job that needs force, not into a confrontation. If a disagreement starts, step out for ten minutes before you answer. Sleep helps.",
"transit:Sun:Jupiter:conjunction":"Optimism and confidence swell for about two days. You see possibilities and feel generous, so this is a good time to say yes to an invitation, share what you know, or sign up for a class. Watch the habit of promising more than you can deliver.",
"transit:Sun:Jupiter:easy":"A friendly stretch of two days in which things feel possible. Your outlook is wide and people respond to your good humor. Reach out to someone who could teach you something, or make plans for a trip or course. Be generous with time rather than money.",
"transit:Sun:Jupiter:hard":"Appetite outruns judgment for two days. You may want to say yes to everything, take on a bigger plan, or eat and spend a little too freely. Enjoy the enthusiasm, but write down the commitments before agreeing, and sleep on the large ones. Generosity is fine in small doses.",
"transit:Sun:Saturn:conjunction":"A serious, sober two days. You are aware of what you owe and what you want to build, and energy feels lower but steadier. Use it for a task needing patience: paperwork, a budget review, a clear list. Rest in the evening, because the day asks a lot.",
"transit:Sun:Saturn:easy":"Steady effort pays off over two days. Your focus is calm and your standards are realistic, which makes it an excellent time for dull but important work. Sort the files, set a schedule, or finish what you started. Small, solid progress counts here. Finish one thing before lunch.",
"transit:Sun:Saturn:hard":"Two heavy days when your energy meets a wall. You may feel doubtful, tired or criticized, and everything seems to take longer. Do not judge your whole life by one low day. Do the minimum that matters, ask for help with one item, and go to bed early.",
"transit:Sun:Ascendant:conjunction":"The spotlight turns toward how you appear for about two days. You come across with more presence than usual, and a fresh start feels natural. Change something visible: a haircut, a different outfit, a clearer way of introducing yourself. Begin the small thing you keep postponing.",
"transit:Sun:Ascendant:easy":"A friendly day or two for making an impression. You look and sound at ease, so use it to introduce yourself, take a photo you like, or begin something new in a low-pressure way. People tend to meet you halfway, so let them. A simple hello works.",
"transit:Sun:Ascendant:hard":"For two days the way you come across may not match how you feel inside, and other people can seem to push against you. Slow down in new situations and listen before you present your view. Pick clothes you are comfortable in and do not force a first impression.",
"transit:Sun:Midheaven:conjunction":"Your work life is in the spotlight for about two days. People notice what you do, and you can feel clear about where you are heading. Send the update, share the result, or ask for the meeting. Pick one visible job and do it well.",
"transit:Sun:Midheaven:easy":"A cooperative two days for career matters. Colleagues and bosses are easier to approach, and your goals look reachable. Ask for feedback, show a finished piece of work, or write down the next step you want in your working life. Act while the door is open.",
"transit:Sun:Midheaven:hard":"Your private wishes and your public role tug in different directions for two days. Work may feel demanding, or someone in charge may seem hard to please. Keep your tone professional, document what you have done, and avoid big career statements until the pressure eases.",
"transit:Mercury:Sun:conjunction":"Your mind and your sense of purpose meet for a few days, so thoughts feel important and personal. Use it to write down what you actually want, or to say it aloud to someone. If Mercury is moving backward, reread before sending and revisit an old plan rather than starting a new one.",
"transit:Mercury:Sun:easy":"Talking about yourself is easy for a few days. You can explain what you want in plain words, so pitch the idea, update your profile, or tell someone what you have been working toward. Listeners are receptive. Keep it short and clear, and write one decision down.",
"transit:Mercury:Sun:hard":"Words and identity collide for a few days. You may feel misunderstood, or say something more forcefully than you meant. Pause before replying, repeat back what you heard, and put important points in writing. Do not defend your whole character over one comment. Listen first, then explain.",
"transit:Mercury:Moon:conjunction":"Thoughts and feelings run together for a few days, so you think about what you feel and feel what you think. It is a good time to journal, call family, or talk through something that has been sitting in your chest. Wait a day before sending an emotional message.",
"transit:Mercury:Moon:easy":"Finding words for feelings comes easily for a few days. Say the kind thing you usually leave unsaid, or have the gentle talk at home. Writing in a notebook at night sorts out a tangled mood. People feel heard by you right now, so listen back.",
"transit:Mercury:Moon:hard":"Head and heart disagree for a few days. You may overthink a mood, or react to a word more strongly than it deserves. Before replying, ask whether you are hungry, tired, or truly hurt. Keep texts short, and have difficult talks in person, not in writing.",
"transit:Mercury:Mercury:conjunction":"Your thinking is sharpened for a few days, as if the mind has been reset. Ideas, errands and conversations move faster. Make the lists, answer the backlog, learn something small. If Mercury is retrograde, use the time to revise and finish old messages rather than starting new ones.",
"transit:Mercury:Mercury:easy":"Your mind is quick and organized for a few days, and learning feels light. Take the class, study the tricky document, or finally sort the inbox. Conversations flow, so make the call that needs persuasion. Take notes as you go, since they are useful later.",
"transit:Mercury:Mercury:hard":"Mental static for a few days: too many thoughts, crossed signals, and small mistakes in dates or numbers. Slow down, double-check addresses and times, and confirm plans in writing. Do one thing at a time. If a conversation goes in circles, pause and come back tomorrow.",
"transit:Mercury:Venus:conjunction":"Words turn kind and charming for a few days. It is a good moment to write a love note, compliment a colleague, or talk through a shared purchase calmly. Your taste is sharp, so pick the gift or choose the design. Keep promises light and genuine.",
"transit:Mercury:Venus:easy":"Conversation is pleasant and diplomatic for a few days. You find the right tone for a sensitive topic, so ask the favor, patch up a small rift, or negotiate something gently. Set up a coffee with someone you like. A thoughtful message goes a long way.",
"transit:Mercury:Venus:hard":"What you say and what you value pull apart for a few days. You may flatter to avoid conflict, or worry aloud about money and affection. Say the honest thing kindly instead of the easy thing. Hold off on bargains and sign nothing in a rush.",
"transit:Mercury:Mars:conjunction":"Speech gets quick and sharp for a few days. Your mind is decisive and fast, which helps with debates, deadlines and hard calls. It also means words can land like darts. Make the tough phone call, but read it aloud first and cut the harshest line.",
"transit:Mercury:Mars:easy":"A confident, direct few days. You can say what needs saying and be heard, so argue your case, ask for what you are owed, or start the task you have been planning. Your mind stays fast without being rough. Do the hardest message first thing in the morning.",
"transit:Mercury:Mars:hard":"Tempers and tongues run hot for a few days. Debates sharpen into quarrels, and snap decisions look worse later. Before pressing send, count to ten, then trim the angriest sentence. Put the energy into a workout, a deadline, or a bold but careful plan. Sleep on any ultimatum.",
"transit:Mercury:Jupiter:conjunction":"Big ideas and big talk for a few days. Your mind is expansive and hopeful, which suits planning a trip, studying a new subject, or writing something with ambition. Check the details, since optimism rounds numbers up. Share your plan with a friend who will ask good questions.",
"transit:Mercury:Jupiter:easy":"Learning and talking feel generous for a few days. You see the larger picture and others like hearing it. Pitch the idea, sign up for a course, or write to someone who might guide you. Offer encouragement freely. Keep one eye on the calendar. Say yes to the small invitation.",
"transit:Mercury:Jupiter:hard":"Talk outruns facts for a few days. You may overpromise, exaggerate, or lose track of small print. Read the whole message before replying, and check numbers twice. Write down what you agreed to, and trim a plan that has grown too large. Smaller promises keep you reliable.",
"transit:Mercury:Saturn:conjunction":"Thinking gets serious and thorough for a few days. You are good at plain, careful work: contracts to read, schedules to fix, budgets to review. Words come slowly but accurately. Be wary of gloomy self-talk, and give yourself one encouraging sentence per task. Slow and exact is the goal.",
"transit:Mercury:Saturn:easy":"Disciplined thought comes easily for a few days. Use it for the dull, important job: outline the report, make the checklist, learn the rule, or draft the plan in steps. Others take you seriously now. Fewer words, well chosen, carry weight. Finish one boring task completely, and tick it off.",
"transit:Mercury:Saturn:hard":"Your mind feels heavy for a few days, with doubts, critical self-talk, or a stern response from someone in authority. Keep to facts and avoid predicting the worst. Break the task into small pieces and do the first one. Ask a trusted person for a second opinion.",
"transit:Mercury:Ascendant:conjunction":"You talk and think your way into the world for a few days. First impressions are quick and lively, and new contacts come easily. Update how you introduce yourself, answer messages promptly, or start the small project you keep describing. Watch for nervous chatter. Breathe between sentences.",
"transit:Mercury:Ascendant:easy":"Your voice lands well for a few days. You come across as clear, friendly and curious, so go to the event, introduce yourself, or speak up first. Begin a new routine such as a daily note or a language app. Easy chat opens doors. Say hello first.",
"transit:Mercury:Ascendant:hard":"How you speak and how you are received are slightly off for a few days. You may feel scattered, or notice people taking your words the wrong way. Slow your pace, ask what others meant, and keep your first message simple. New starts can wait until your head clears.",
"transit:Mercury:Midheaven:conjunction":"Work conversations come to the front for a few days. You can explain your goals, present to the right person, or tidy up your professional messaging. Send the proposal, update the resume, or request the meeting. Be precise, because people remember what you say now.",
"transit:Mercury:Midheaven:easy":"Career talk goes smoothly for a few days. You express your ideas clearly to colleagues and people in charge, so schedule the interview, share the plan, or ask for the introduction. Write your next three professional steps down while your thinking is orderly. Keep the message brief.",
"transit:Mercury:Midheaven:hard":"Messages about work cross or clash for a few days. A boss may read your words differently than intended, or your plans may need defending. Put key points in writing, confirm what was agreed, and keep emails calm. Revisit your direction before announcing any big change.",
"transit:Venus:Sun:conjunction":"Your warmth is easy to see for the next few days, and people respond to it. You feel more likeable and more at ease in your own skin. Use that: say yes to an invitation, wear the thing you save for good days, or tell someone plainly what you appreciate about them. Enjoy it without needing it to prove anything.",
"transit:Venus:Sun:easy":"A pleasant opening shows up for a few days, where your sense of self and your enjoyment of life pull in the same direction. Social effort pays back easily now. Contact an old friend, host something small, or ask for a favor you have felt shy about. The ease is real but passive, so you have to reach for it.",
"transit:Venus:Sun:hard":"Wanting to be liked and wanting to be yourself pull against each other for a few days. You may bend to keep the peace, then resent it, or notice a small gap between what you value and how you spend your time. Pick one thing where you stay honest even if it is slightly awkward. The friction is asking what you really want.",
"transit:Venus:Moon:conjunction":"Your feelings turn soft and tender for a few days, and comfort matters more than usual. You may crave company, home cooking, or a quiet evening with someone you trust. Lean into it. Cook something slow, tidy one corner so it feels nice, or send a warm message to family. Watch for taking small slights too personally.",
"transit:Venus:Moon:easy":"Emotional ease is on offer for a few days. Conversations about feelings go smoother, and home feels like a place to breathe. Use the opening: say the kind thing you have been holding back, invite someone over, or put flowers on your own table. It rewards a small gesture, and you can feel the difference quickly.",
"transit:Venus:Moon:hard":"What you need and what you want do not quite match for a few days. You might crave closeness and then feel crowded, or reach for sweets and soft blankets to avoid a feeling. Name the need out loud instead of hinting. Ask for one specific thing, like an evening together or an evening alone. Tension here points you toward honesty about comfort.",
"transit:Venus:Mercury:conjunction":"Your words come out gracious and charming for the next few days. This suits difficult conversations, because you can say hard things kindly. Write the message you have been postponing, compliment someone in specific terms, or negotiate with a smile. Be careful that being agreeable does not turn into saying whatever people want to hear.",
"transit:Venus:Mercury:easy":"Talk flows easily for a few days, and your ideas land well with others. It is a good stretch for brainstorming with a friend, writing something with warmth in it, or making plans that include people you like. Send the message, start the chat, or read aloud what you wrote. A little effort turns this ease into something real.",
"transit:Venus:Mercury:hard":"Your head and your heart send mixed messages for a few days. You may overthink a friendly text, say something sweet that you do not fully mean, or struggle to decide what you prefer. Write down both sides before replying to anyone. Speak slowly. The friction pushes you to say what you actually think, not what keeps things smooth.",
"transit:Venus:Venus:conjunction":"A short reset of your own tastes and attachments arrives for a few days. You notice what you truly love and what you only tolerate. It is a good time to treat yourself in a way that matches your values, to tell someone you care about them, or to look again at how you think about money. Spend with intention, not to fill a mood.",
"transit:Venus:Venus:easy":"Affection and enjoyment come with little effort for a few days. People are receptive, and so are you. Make a plan that involves beauty or good company: a long dinner, a walk with someone, a room rearranged to please you. Say what you value out loud. The opening is gentle, so it needs a small push from you.",
"transit:Venus:Venus:hard":"Your values and your habits disagree for a few days. A relationship, a purchase or a pleasure you have been ignoring starts to itch. Ask yourself what you are actually getting from it. Make one small change that fits what you care about, such as saying no to an invitation or yes to a quieter plan. Discomfort here is a nudge to realign.",
"transit:Venus:Mars:conjunction":"Attraction and drive blend for a few days, and you can feel it. Warmth gets a push behind it, so flirting, planning a date or going after something you want comes naturally. Channel the energy into a bold but kind move: ask someone out, start a project you love. Notice impatience, because wanting it now can crowd out listening.",
"transit:Venus:Mars:easy":"Desire and action cooperate for a few days. You know what you want, and you have the nerve to say so without a fight. Use it to ask for what you like, in a relationship or at work. Suggest the plan, make the call, take the first step. Tact and courage work as a pair, so use both on purpose.",
"transit:Venus:Mars:hard":"Wanting closeness and wanting to be in charge collide for a few days. Small irritations flare in relationships, or you feel pulled in two directions about what you want. Treat the heat as energy, not a verdict. Take a brisk walk before a hard conversation, then ask for what you need in one clear sentence. Honest friction clears the air.",
"transit:Venus:Jupiter:conjunction":"Generosity and good cheer are strong for a few days. You feel expansive about people, food, plans and fun. Share it: host friends, say a big thank you, plan something to look forward to. The risk is overdoing it, such as extra helpings or grand promises. Let enthusiasm lead, then check what you actually agreed to.",
"transit:Venus:Jupiter:easy":"Optimism and affection line up for a few days, and generous gestures are well received. Social plans, travel ideas and kind surprises all go well. Say yes to an invitation that stretches you a little, or offer your time to someone who would value it. The good mood is real, but it gives most to people who take a step.",
"transit:Venus:Jupiter:hard":"Appetite runs ahead of good sense for a few days. You may want more of everything: more attention, more treats, more promises. Notice where enjoyment is tipping into excess, or where you are saying yes to please people. Choose one pleasure and do it fully instead of five halfway. The pull is toward moderation that still feels generous.",
"transit:Venus:Saturn:conjunction":"Affection meets seriousness for a few days. Some feelings may seem cooler or more guarded, yet commitments feel sturdier. It suits a sober look at what you value and what it asks of you. Have the grown-up conversation about expectations, or keep a promise quietly. Loyalty is easier than lightness right now, and that is fine.",
"transit:Venus:Saturn:easy":"Steady, mature affection is on offer for a few days. Relationships reward reliability, and you can show care through consistency rather than grand gestures. Fix the small thing you promised, set a regular date, or write down a sensible budget for something you love. Patience and warmth work well together here, if you use them.",
"transit:Venus:Saturn:hard":"A cool, lonely or self-critical mood can show up for a few days. You may feel unappreciated or doubt whether you deserve affection. Do not read it as the final word. Do one concrete thing: reach out first, or set a limit kindly. Check money habits as habits, not as a judgment. The pressure asks what is worth your commitment.",
"transit:Venus:Ascendant:conjunction":"You are more attractive and more approachable for a few days, and you can tell. Others pick up on your warmth before you say anything. Use it to start something: introduce yourself, update how you look in a way you enjoy, or take the lead in a social plan. Enjoy the attention without letting it set your mood.",
"transit:Venus:Ascendant:easy":"A gracious first impression comes easily for a few days. People meet you halfway, and new situations feel friendly. Say yes to introductions, wear something that makes you feel good, and let your manner be a little softer. The opening rewards small, visible actions, like attending the event or starting the conversation.",
"transit:Venus:Ascendant:hard":"Your image and your real wishes pull apart for a few days. You may feel too eager to please, or notice how much you adjust yourself around others. Try one small act of plain honesty in how you present yourself, such as stating a preference or declining an invitation. The friction is about being liked versus being known.",
"transit:Venus:Midheaven:conjunction":"Charm helps your public side for a few days. Colleagues, clients and bosses respond well to your tone. Use it to ask for a meeting, present an idea, or tidy how your work looks to others. Likeability opens doors, but pair it with substance, so what you show has something real behind it.",
"transit:Venus:Midheaven:easy":"Goodwill around your work and reputation is available for a few days. People are receptive to your ideas and your manner. Make a polite request, share a piece of work, or thank someone who has helped your path. A graceful tone does a lot here, and a small visible step is enough to use it.",
"transit:Venus:Midheaven:hard":"Wanting to be liked at work and wanting to do the right thing may clash for a few days. You might hold back a hard truth to keep things pleasant, or feel your values and your job drifting apart. Name one standard you refuse to trade for approval. Speak up kindly about it. The tension asks what you want your name to stand for.",
"transit:Mars:Sun:conjunction":"Energy runs high for about a week, and you feel capable of more than usual. Motivation is strong, so aim it. Start the project that needs a push, train hard, or have the direct conversation. Watch for a short fuse and for pushing past tiredness. Drive works best with a target and a break scheduled in.",
"transit:Mars:Sun:easy":"Vitality and willpower line up for about a week. You can get started and keep going without much inner argument. Pick a task you have been circling, like a stalled application or a big clean-out, and give it a solid block of time. Good energy is wasted if left idle, so spend it on something that matters to you.",
"transit:Mars:Sun:hard":"Your drive and your sense of self rub against each other for about a week. You may feel impatient, competitive, or ready to argue over small things. Use the heat as fuel: exercise, a hard task, or a clear boundary stated calmly. Before reacting to someone, wait one breath. The friction pushes you to claim your ground.",
"transit:Mars:Moon:conjunction":"Feelings run hot for about a week, and reactions come fast. Irritation, protectiveness or restlessness at home can show up before you notice it. Give the energy a physical outlet: scrub something, walk fast, rearrange a room. Say what you feel in plain words before it turns into a snap at whoever is nearby.",
"transit:Mars:Moon:easy":"Action and emotion cooperate for about a week. You can act on what you feel without being swept away, which helps with courage at home and with family. Take a practical step on something that has bothered you: have the chore talk, fix the broken thing, or protect an evening for yourself. Feeling gets traction when you move.",
"transit:Mars:Moon:hard":"Moods can flare for about a week, and small things hit a nerve. You may feel defensive at home or snappy with people you love. Anger is energy, so treat it that way: move your body, then talk. Ask for space instead of picking a fight. The friction shows where your needs have gone unspoken.",
"transit:Mars:Mercury:conjunction":"Your mind is sharp and quick for about a week, and your words have bite. This is excellent for debate, problem solving and finishing tasks fast. Make the decision, send the direct email, or fix the tricky bug. Read it over once before sending, because speed can tip into bluntness and arguments you did not intend.",
"transit:Mars:Mercury:easy":"Thinking and action work together for about a week. You can say what you mean and then do something about it. Use it to negotiate, pitch an idea, or finish a stack of small errands in one go. Clear, confident speech lands well now, so ask the question you have been holding back.",
"transit:Mars:Mercury:hard":"Impatience colors your thinking for about a week. Conversations can turn into arguments, and snap judgments feel convincing. Slow down: count to three before replying, and write the sharp message but wait a day to send it. Put the mental energy into a demanding task instead. The friction asks for clearer, kinder directness.",
"transit:Mars:Venus:conjunction":"Desire and attraction are strongly stirred for about a week. Warmth has a push behind it, so you notice who and what you want. Act with care: plan the date, say the flirty thing, start the creative project. Be honest about what you want from a person, and check that your pace suits them too.",
"transit:Mars:Venus:easy":"Affection and initiative cooperate for about a week. You can go after what you like without being clumsy about it. Make the first move, suggest the plan, or take a bold step on something creative. Mixing courage with kindness gets results, so ask directly and give the other person room to answer.",
"transit:Mars:Venus:hard":"Wanting and being wanted get tangled for about a week. Expect more friction in close relationships: sharp words, impatience, or a pull toward someone or something that is not simple. Channel the heat into a workout or a project, and discuss disagreements without keeping score. The tension asks you to be clear about what you desire.",
"transit:Mars:Mars:conjunction":"A fresh surge of drive arrives for about a week, a kind of personal restart. You have more push, more nerve and less patience. Begin something you have been postponing, such as a workout routine or a hard conversation. Keep an eye on temper and on starting too many things. Pick one target and hit it.",
"transit:Mars:Mars:easy":"Energy is easy to use for about a week, and effort pays back quickly. You have the stamina to finish things and the nerve to speak up. Tackle the item on your list that needs persistence, or take on a physical challenge you enjoy. Steady use beats a single burst, so spread the effort across the week.",
"transit:Mars:Mars:hard":"Restless, edgy energy builds for about a week. Frustration arrives fast, and you may feel blocked or competitive. Do not sit on it. Exercise, clear a backlog, or make the decision you have been avoiding. Pause before replying to a provocation. The pressure pushes you to act, and the choice is how.",
"transit:Mars:Jupiter:conjunction":"Big energy and big ideas meet for about a week. You feel bold, optimistic and ready to go further than usual. Aim it at a stretch goal: sign up for the class, plan the trip, pitch the larger idea. Watch for overreach, like promising too much or taking on more than a week can hold. Scale the plan to real hours.",
"transit:Mars:Jupiter:easy":"Confidence and drive support each other for about a week. Taking a chance feels reasonable, and your effort reaches further than expected. Say yes to an ambitious task, apply for something you thought was a reach, or begin a plan you believe in. A small first step turns the good mood into momentum.",
"transit:Mars:Jupiter:hard":"Enthusiasm outruns judgment for about a week. You may take on too much, argue over beliefs, or push hard for something without checking the details. Let the energy go to one worthwhile goal and read the fine print on the rest. Debate is fine if you listen as well. The friction teaches proportion.",
"transit:Mars:Saturn:conjunction":"Drive meets resistance for about a week, like pushing a heavy door. Progress is slow but real, and disciplined effort counts. Choose one demanding task and work at it in steady blocks. Frustration is normal, so do not throw it at other people. Patience, a plan and a clear limit on your time will carry you through.",
"transit:Mars:Saturn:easy":"Effort and discipline cooperate for about a week. You can work hard without burning out, and structure helps instead of confining. Build a routine, finish the long task, or train with a plan. Slow, careful work pays back now, so set a schedule and keep it for a few days.",
"transit:Mars:Saturn:hard":"Ambition keeps hitting a wall for about a week, and frustration builds. Delays, rules or your own caution can feel like brakes. Do not force the door. Break the task into smaller pieces and do the first piece well. Express anger as a calm request, not an outburst. The pressure builds stamina if you stay with it.",
"transit:Mars:Ascendant:conjunction":"You come across as forceful and direct for about a week, and your presence is strong. This helps with starting things and standing up for yourself. Take the lead: begin the workout, start the project, state your position. Watch for being abrupt with people. A bold move plus a calm tone is a strong mix.",
"transit:Mars:Ascendant:easy":"Confidence is easy to access for about a week, and you carry yourself with more energy. New starts feel natural. Introduce yourself, take the first step on a plan, or begin a physical routine. People respond well to directness now, so use it on something you care about instead of leaving it for later.",
"transit:Mars:Ascendant:hard":"You may seem sharper or more aggressive than you intend for about a week, and others push back. Conflicts with people around you can mirror your own impatience. Slow your pace in conversations and pour the extra drive into exercise or a hard task. The friction is asking you to assert yourself without bulldozing anyone.",
"transit:Mars:Midheaven:conjunction":"Ambition is strong for about a week, and your career pulls at you. You may want to lead, compete, or finally act on a goal. Take a concrete step: ask for the project, make the proposal, or finish the visible task. Be careful with rivals and with bluntness toward authority. Work hard and stay professional.",
"transit:Mars:Midheaven:easy":"Energy supports your work life for about a week. Initiative gets noticed, and bold effort goes over well. Volunteer for the harder task, pitch your idea, or make the call that moves your plan forward. Prompt action now shows leadership, so choose one goal and give it steady attention.",
"transit:Mars:Midheaven:hard":"Friction with bosses, rivals or your own career plans can build for about a week. You may feel blocked, or tempted to push back too hard. Pick your battles. Write down what you actually want from the situation, then make one firm, polite request. The pressure is asking you to claim your direction with purpose, not temper.",
"transit:Jupiter:Sun:conjunction":"Confidence runs higher than usual, and projects that felt too big start to look doable. Jupiter sits on your Sun for several weeks and may pass over it up to three times. Say yes to one larger role or goal, then check your calendar so enthusiasm does not outrun your hours.",
"transit:Jupiter:Sun:easy":"A door is open for being more visible, and it swings easiest if you push it. Over the coming weeks, which may arrive in more than one pass, offer your ideas, lead one small thing, or tell people what you are working toward. Support tends to gather around those who ask for it.",
"transit:Jupiter:Sun:hard":"Your appetite for more is bigger than your schedule right now. Jupiter pushes against your Sun for weeks, possibly in three passes, and the pull is toward overpromising. Use it: pick the one ambition that matters most, say no to two others, and notice how much steadier the chosen one feels.",
"transit:Jupiter:Moon:conjunction":"Feelings run warm and wide for a few weeks, and home becomes the place where things expand. Jupiter may cross your Moon more than once. Cook for people, fix up a corner of your space, or call the relative you miss. Watch the urge to soothe yourself with extra of everything.",
"transit:Jupiter:Moon:easy":"Emotional ease is available, and it grows when you use it. For the next several weeks, possibly in a few passes, you handle moods better and can be generous without feeling drained. Plan a gathering, make your home a bit more comfortable, or say aloud what you need from the people close to you.",
"transit:Jupiter:Moon:hard":"Moods swell and then overflow. Over several weeks, in one or three passes, Jupiter stirs your Moon so that small feelings seem large and needs seem urgent. Put it to work: name what you actually want from home life, then ask for it plainly. A long walk before big conversations keeps the volume manageable.",
"transit:Jupiter:Mercury:conjunction":"The mind opens up and wants to take in everything. For several weeks, perhaps across three passes, Jupiter lights up your Mercury, so ideas, courses and conversations multiply. Start the course, write the pitch, or draft the long letter. Then trim: pick the two ideas worth finishing and park the rest in a notebook.",
"transit:Jupiter:Mercury:easy":"Learning and talking come easily, and people respond to how you explain things. Over the coming weeks, with a possible second or third pass, your Mercury has a friendly boost. Sign up for a class, send the proposal you have been polishing, or pitch an idea in the meeting. A little effort goes a long way.",
"transit:Jupiter:Mercury:hard":"Too many ideas arrive at once, and details slip through the cracks. Jupiter presses on your Mercury for weeks, perhaps in three passes, which can mean big talk, crowded calendars and skimmed fine print. Reread messages twice, slow down in debates, and write down what you actually agreed to before leaving the room.",
"transit:Jupiter:Venus:conjunction":"Affection and pleasure get a generous lift. Across several weeks, with possibly three passes, Jupiter joins your Venus and makes you more charming, more social and more indulgent. Plan a dinner, tell someone what you appreciate in them, or spend an afternoon on something beautiful. Keep an eye on the second helping, whatever it is.",
"transit:Jupiter:Venus:easy":"Warmth comes easily, and relationships respond when you reach out. For several weeks, perhaps in a few passes, your Venus has a friendly lift. Invite someone to something, give a sincere compliment, or make plans with a friend you have neglected. Ease is on offer here, and it grows with one small gesture.",
"transit:Jupiter:Venus:hard":"Wanting more can sour what you already have. Jupiter pushes against your Venus over several weeks, perhaps in three passes, stirring generosity but also restlessness and a taste for the extravagant. Ask what you value rather than what looks shiny. Talk with a partner about expectations before the grand gestures, and keep gifts thoughtful.",
"transit:Jupiter:Mars:conjunction":"Energy surges and you want to move. Jupiter sits on your Mars across several weeks, maybe in three passes, bringing courage, appetite and a push to start things. Begin the project, sign up for the race, or have the direct conversation. Pace matters: big drive can turn into bluster, so aim it at one clear target.",
"transit:Jupiter:Mars:easy":"Drive and confidence line up, and action pays off more easily than usual. For several weeks, possibly with a second or third pass, your Mars gets a helpful push. Take the first step on the thing you have been circling: ask, apply, enter the competition, or start the workout plan. Momentum is yours if you use it.",
"transit:Jupiter:Mars:hard":"Impatience swells, and so does the urge to charge ahead. Jupiter presses on your Mars for weeks, in one or three passes, making arguments larger and risks seem smaller than they are. Spend the energy on something physical or a real challenge. Before a heated reply, wait one night and ask whether the fight is worth it.",
"transit:Jupiter:Jupiter:conjunction":"A fresh chapter of optimism begins. Jupiter touches its own place in your chart over several weeks, possibly in three passes, so it is a good moment to ask what you believe in and where you want to grow. Write a short list of goals, choose one to learn or travel toward, and start small.",
"transit:Jupiter:Jupiter:easy":"Faith in your own direction comes naturally now. For several weeks, perhaps across three passes, your sense of what is possible has an easy lift. Say yes to a learning opportunity, talk to someone who has gone where you want to go, or share what you know. Openings respond well to curiosity plus a bit of action.",
"transit:Jupiter:Jupiter:hard":"Growth asks you to stretch past what feels reasonable, and the stretch can be uncomfortable. Jupiter presses on its own natal place over several weeks, maybe in three passes, which can spark overreach or a restless sense that your beliefs need updating. Choose one belief to test and one goal to scale up, then keep the rest steady.",
"transit:Jupiter:Saturn:conjunction":"Big hopes meet practical limits, and the two can cooperate. Over several weeks, perhaps in three passes, Jupiter touches your Saturn, so plans gain the backing of a realistic structure. Write out the steps for something ambitious, set a deadline, and divide it into pieces. Optimism supplies the energy, and your discipline gives it a shape.",
"transit:Jupiter:Saturn:easy":"Ambition and patience work well together. For several weeks, with possibly more than one pass, Jupiter eases the load on your Saturn, so responsibility feels lighter. It is a good time to tackle the dull task that supports a larger goal, such as organizing records, mapping the year's milestones, or finishing the long-delayed training.",
"transit:Jupiter:Saturn:hard":"Optimism and caution argue with each other. Jupiter presses on your Saturn for several weeks, perhaps in three passes, so you swing between wanting to expand and fearing the cost. Let both speak. Draw up a plan with a bold goal and a realistic budget of time, then test one small piece before committing to the whole.",
"transit:Jupiter:Ascendant:conjunction":"A fresh, larger version of you steps forward. Across several weeks, maybe in three passes, Jupiter lands on your Ascendant and people notice you more warmly. Update something visible: your photo, your wardrobe, how you introduce yourself. Say hello first at gatherings. Watch for taking up more room than the moment calls for.",
"transit:Jupiter:Ascendant:easy":"First impressions work in your favor, and new beginnings feel welcomed. For several weeks, possibly in a few passes, an easy current runs through how you present yourself. Accept the invitation, start the personal project you keep postponing, or refresh your look. People meet you halfway when you show up openly.",
"transit:Jupiter:Ascendant:hard":"You may feel pulled to be bigger than the moment, and others may push back. Jupiter presses on your Ascendant over several weeks, perhaps in three passes, which makes self-presentation louder and boundaries blurrier. Notice when confidence turns into showing off. Listen first in new groups, and begin one personal change instead of ten.",
"transit:Jupiter:Midheaven:conjunction":"Your professional path widens and people notice what you do. Jupiter sits on your Midheaven for several weeks, maybe across three passes. Make your work visible: update your portfolio, ask for the bigger project, or approach someone who could mentor you. Bring a plan, because opportunity grows when it has a clear aim.",
"transit:Jupiter:Midheaven:easy":"Career doors open with surprisingly little force. For several weeks, possibly across three passes, an easy current supports your reputation and goals. Reach out to someone senior, share your work publicly, or propose the idea you have been holding back. Recognition tends to follow visible effort, so make yours easy to see.",
"transit:Jupiter:Midheaven:hard":"Ambition and obligations jostle for room. Jupiter presses on your Midheaven over several weeks, perhaps in three passes, which can inflate goals or cause friction with authority. Use the tension: clarify what you actually want from your career, then discuss it with a manager or mentor. Decline the project that dilutes your focus.",
"transit:Saturn:Sun:conjunction":"Life asks you to get serious about what matters. Saturn sits on your Sun for weeks to months, possibly in three passes, and your pace becomes more deliberate. Trim commitments, protect your sleep and meals as ordinary good habits, and choose one purpose to work on steadily. The reward is a firmer sense of who you are.",
"transit:Saturn:Sun:easy":"Steady effort gets recognized. For a month or more, possibly in a few passes, discipline comes with less strain and you can build on your identity. Set a modest daily practice, accept the responsibility offered, or finish the thing you started. Slow progress now holds up later, so choose reliability over speed.",
"transit:Saturn:Sun:hard":"Expectations, yours and other people's, feel heavy and your sense of purpose gets tested. Saturn presses on your Sun for months, perhaps in three passes. This is useful pressure: it shows what is worth keeping. Write down your top three priorities, hand back one obligation that is not yours, and do the hardest task first.",
"transit:Saturn:Moon:conjunction":"Emotional needs ask for structure. Saturn on your Moon, for weeks to months and perhaps three passes, can make feelings quieter and more guarded. Make comfort practical: keep a regular bedtime, set up a calm corner at home, and tell someone close how you are really doing. Being reserved is fine, being unreachable is not.",
"transit:Saturn:Moon:easy":"Emotional steadiness comes through routine. For a month or more, in perhaps three passes, you handle responsibilities at home and with family well. Build a rhythm that supports you: regular meals, a weekly call with someone you love, a tidy kitchen. Small reliable habits make you feel safe, and others lean on your calm.",
"transit:Saturn:Moon:hard":"Feelings meet obstacles, and home or family can seem to ask more than they give. Saturn presses on your Moon for months, with possibly three passes. Loneliness or self-criticism can show up. Use it to name what you actually need, then ask for it in plain words. Do one small act of care for yourself each day.",
"transit:Saturn:Mercury:conjunction":"Thinking turns careful and exacting. Saturn lands on your Mercury for weeks to months, maybe over three passes, so you weigh words and plans closely. It suits finishing a report, studying seriously, or writing the plan down. Keep sentences short and promises realistic, and do not let caution talk you out of speaking.",
"transit:Saturn:Mercury:easy":"Clear, orderly thinking comes without a fight. For a month or more, possibly in a few passes, you can organize ideas, learn something difficult, and be heard as reliable. Draft the outline, make the checklist, or take a structured course. Practical conversations go well, so settle the dull but important details now.",
"transit:Saturn:Mercury:hard":"Worry and self-doubt crowd the mind, and communication can feel stiff. Saturn presses on your Mercury for months, perhaps in three passes. Turn it into rigor: check facts, reduce a long plan to its first three steps, and speak up once rather than rehearsing endlessly. Write the worries down, then pick one you can act on today.",
"transit:Saturn:Venus:conjunction":"Relationships and pleasures get a reality check. Saturn sits on your Venus for weeks to months, possibly in three passes, so affection may feel more serious and slower to warm. Show commitment through steady acts: keep the promise, arrive on time, tidy a shared space. Favor quality over quantity in who you spend time with.",
"transit:Saturn:Venus:easy":"Loyalty and stable affection feel natural. For a month or more, in maybe a few passes, relationships reward patience and consistency. Plan a recurring dinner with a friend, say plainly what you value in someone, or commit to a shared routine. Closeness built slowly tends to be the kind that lasts.",
"transit:Saturn:Venus:hard":"Closeness feels harder to reach, and you may measure yourself against other people. Saturn presses on your Venus for months, perhaps in three passes. Use it to look at what you really value. Have the honest talk about expectations, give less time to ties that only drain you, and be kind to yourself rather than waiting to feel worthy.",
"transit:Saturn:Mars:conjunction":"Drive gets focused and disciplined. Saturn lands on your Mars for weeks to months, maybe over three passes, so effort is slower but more deliberate. Pick one long task and work on it in fixed blocks, with rest between them. Frustration is the signal to adjust the method, not to push harder.",
"transit:Saturn:Mars:easy":"Persistence pays. For a month or more, possibly in a few passes, energy and discipline cooperate. Make a training schedule, finish the project with the firm deadline, or take on the chore you have avoided, like clearing the garage. Steady, patient effort outlasts bursts, and you can feel the progress.",
"transit:Saturn:Mars:hard":"Obstacles block your drive, and anger can build behind them. Saturn presses on your Mars for months, perhaps in three passes. Treat delays as a request to plan better. Break the goal into stages, channel frustration into a hard workout, and say what bothers you early and calmly instead of letting it simmer.",
"transit:Saturn:Jupiter:conjunction":"Hopes need a framework to survive. Saturn sits on your Jupiter for weeks to months, perhaps in three passes, so big plans meet practical questions. That is useful: write down the real steps, deadlines and costs of something you want. Optimism with a plan is stronger than optimism alone, so keep the vision and add the schedule.",
"transit:Saturn:Jupiter:easy":"Faith and realism support each other. For a month or more, possibly in a few passes, growth comes through steady work. Enroll in a longer course, set up a learning routine, or commit to a goal that takes a year. Skills and credentials you build slowly now carry real weight later.",
"transit:Saturn:Jupiter:hard":"Enthusiasm runs into limits, and it may feel as if the world keeps saying no. Saturn presses on your Jupiter for months, perhaps in three passes. Let it prune: drop the plan that never had a foundation and keep the one that does. Talk to someone experienced, rewrite goals with realistic timelines, and begin with the smallest workable version.",
"transit:Saturn:Saturn:conjunction":"A new cycle of responsibility begins. Saturn touches its own place in your chart over months, perhaps in three passes, and you review what you have built. Ask which commitments are truly yours. Keep those, put them in order, and release the rest. It is a serious but clarifying season, and a good one for setting long goals.",
"transit:Saturn:Saturn:easy":"Your own sense of structure is working for you. For a month or more, possibly in a few passes, discipline feels natural and duties feel manageable. Take a step on a long-term goal, mentor someone, or reorganize your schedule so the important things come first. Habits started now are easy to keep.",
"transit:Saturn:Saturn:hard":"Duties and boundaries get tested, and the way you have organized life feels too tight or too thin. Saturn presses on its own place in your chart for months, perhaps in three passes. Review your commitments honestly. Keep the ones that serve you, renegotiate the rest, and ask for help without treating it as failure.",
"transit:Saturn:Ascendant:conjunction":"A serious, more grounded you comes forward. Saturn sits on your Ascendant for weeks to months, possibly in three passes, which can make you seem reserved or more mature than usual. Streamline your image: simplify your wardrobe, set a daily routine, and start something new with a long horizon. People see you as dependable.",
"transit:Saturn:Ascendant:easy":"Self-discipline suits you and others notice. For a month or more, possibly in a few passes, you can start habits and change how you show up with little struggle. Commit to a daily routine, dress for the role you want, or introduce yourself with more clarity. Presence built patiently looks effortless later.",
"transit:Saturn:Ascendant:hard":"Self-doubt and the sense of being judged get louder. Saturn presses on your Ascendant for months, perhaps in three passes, so new starts feel slow and heavy. Use it to rebuild how you present yourself on your own terms. Pick one personal habit to build, state your plain view in meetings, and let results carry you rather than approval.",
"transit:Saturn:Midheaven:conjunction":"Career responsibility peaks and the work begins to define you. Saturn sits on your Midheaven for weeks to months, maybe in three passes. Look honestly at where your path is going. Ask for clear expectations, build the skill the next role requires, and accept a visible duty. A reputation formed now is earned and tends to hold.",
"transit:Saturn:Midheaven:easy":"Effort at work earns trust. For a month or more, possibly in a few passes, authority figures respond well to your reliability. Volunteer to lead a project, document your results, or set a three-year goal and name the first milestone. Build your reputation steadily, because there is no need to hurry.",
"transit:Saturn:Midheaven:hard":"Career pressure is real: deadlines, authority figures and doubts about direction. Saturn presses on your Midheaven for months, perhaps in three passes. Treat it as a reality check. Ask what you want your work to look like in five years, close the gaps in skills or standing, and bring one hard conversation with a supervisor forward.",
"transit:Uranus:Sun:conjunction":"Something in you wants out of the old script, and it asks for room across most of a year. The point is crossed three times as the planet turns retrograde and direct again. Try one new habit in how you spend your mornings, keep it for a few weeks, and let your sense of who you are widen gradually.",
"transit:Uranus:Sun:easy":"A door to a more independent version of yourself stands open for much of the year, and it swings back around twice more. Nothing forces you through it. Pick one thing you have always done the expected way, such as how you spend a free Saturday, and do it your own way. Repeat it when the planet returns.",
"transit:Uranus:Sun:hard":"Part of your life feels too tight, and the friction nudges you to loosen it over many months. The planet passes the point three times, so the nudge returns after each pause. Name one commitment that no longer fits and renegotiate it with a calm conversation. Freedom here comes from honest adjustments, not from dramatic exits.",
"transit:Uranus:Moon:conjunction":"Your emotional world is being refreshed over a long stretch, most of a year, with three passes over the point. Old comfort habits may stop soothing you and new ones start to. Rearrange one corner of your home, or change a nightly ritual, and notice what feels better. Tell people close to you that you are experimenting.",
"transit:Uranus:Moon:easy":"Your feelings have more elbow room than usual, and this lasts most of a year, returning twice as the planet turns around. It is a good season to try a different way of looking after yourself. Visit a place you have never relaxed in, or cook something unfamiliar for someone you love. Let the results guide what stays.",
"transit:Uranus:Moon:hard":"Your need for security and your need for fresh air pull against each other for most of a year, with the tug repeating on three passes. Restlessness at home is information, not a fault. Pick one routine to loosen, such as the way weekends are arranged, and talk it through with the people it affects before changing it.",
"transit:Uranus:Mercury:conjunction":"Ideas arrive sideways and quickly across most of a year, with three passes over the point. Your thinking wants new tools and new company. Keep a running note on your phone for the odd thoughts, then review it each month. Sign up for a short class in something you know nothing about and see which thread keeps pulling.",
"transit:Uranus:Mercury:easy":"Your mind runs freely and finds shortcuts, and the window stays open for most of a year as the planet passes three times. Use it for learning that you have been postponing. Try a different method to study or organize your work, such as talking ideas aloud instead of writing them, and keep whichever way proves fastest.",
"transit:Uranus:Mercury:hard":"Your usual way of thinking and talking is being challenged for most of a year, and the challenge repeats on each of three passes. Plans may get interrupted by better ideas, which is irritating at first. Leave extra room in your schedule and write down decisions so you can compare them later. Listen to the odd opinion before dismissing it.",
"transit:Uranus:Venus:conjunction":"Your taste, your affections and your attitude toward money are all being freshened across most of a year, with three passes. What attracted you before may feel flat, and something unexpected may appeal instead. Pay attention to that pull without rushing. Spend a small amount on a new pleasure, and tell a partner or friend honestly what you want more of.",
"transit:Uranus:Venus:easy":"Affection and enjoyment come with more variety for most of a year, and the planet returns twice more to the point. Say yes to an invitation outside your usual circle, or suggest a new kind of evening to someone you care about. Easy openings like this reward a little initiative, so make one plan a month instead of waiting.",
"transit:Uranus:Venus:hard":"What you value and how you love are being tested for most of a year, with the strain returning on three passes. You may feel pulled between closeness and independence. Talk plainly with the people involved about what each of you needs, and review any money habit that no longer matches your values. Honest answers beat quiet resentment here.",
"transit:Uranus:Mars:conjunction":"Your drive is electric and a little unpredictable for most of a year, passing the point three times. Energy comes in bursts. Give it a regular outlet, such as a new sport, a hard project or a morning run, so it does not leak into snappy moments. Start things you have been circling, and finish the first stage before starting another.",
"transit:Uranus:Mars:easy":"Initiative feels natural and quick over most of a year, and the planet comes back to this point twice more. Use the boldness for something you have hesitated to start: pitch the idea, sign up for the event, rebuild the workspace. Take action early in the week while the energy is fresh, and review progress at the end of each month.",
"transit:Uranus:Mars:hard":"Impatience and a short fuse are more likely for most of a year, with three passes keeping the pressure coming back. The energy is real and wants a destination. Pick a demanding physical or creative outlet, and pause for a slow breath before replying in a heated moment. Channel the urge to break free into one concrete project.",
"transit:Uranus:Jupiter:conjunction":"Your outlook widens in surprising directions across most of a year, with three passes over the point. Belief, travel and learning all invite new angles. Say yes to an idea that stretches you, and test it on a small scale first. Read something from a perspective far from your own, and notice what it loosens in your assumptions.",
"transit:Uranus:Jupiter:easy":"Opportunities for growth show up through unusual routes for most of a year, and the planet returns twice more. Stay curious about people outside your usual field. Accept one invitation that seems slightly off your path, such as a workshop or a trip with different company. Easy gifts like this need a reply, so answer within a few days.",
"transit:Uranus:Jupiter:hard":"Your appetite for more and your wish for freedom may overreach for most of a year, with the push repeating over three passes. Big plans appear fast. Write each one down and sleep on it for a week before committing time or goodwill. Keep the ones that still excite you afterward, and let the rest go without regret.",
"transit:Uranus:Saturn:conjunction":"Structure and freedom meet at one point for most of a year, with three passes. The routines and responsibilities you rely on may need an update. Choose one system, such as a budget method, a work schedule or a household chore split, and redesign it on purpose. Small, tested changes hold up better than a total overhaul.",
"transit:Uranus:Saturn:easy":"Discipline and innovation work together for most of a year, and the planet returns twice more. This is a good period to modernize something solid. Take a long-standing routine, such as how you track tasks, and try one smarter tool or order for it. Keep what saves time, and drop the rest after a month.",
"transit:Uranus:Saturn:hard":"Old structures feel confining for most of a year, and the strain returns over three passes. Rules or obligations you once accepted may now chafe. Do not tear anything down in a rush. List what each commitment gives you, then ask for one specific change, such as flexible hours or a shared load. Patient negotiation lasts longer than rebellion.",
"transit:Uranus:Ascendant:conjunction":"Your outward self is in refresh mode for most of a year, with three passes over the point. People may notice you looking or acting differently. Experiment with how you present yourself, such as a haircut, a wardrobe change or a new way of introducing yourself. Keep what feels truer and let the rest be a trial.",
"transit:Uranus:Ascendant:easy":"A fresh style or a first step in a new direction comes easily over most of a year, and the planet returns twice. People respond well to your originality now. Start something you have wanted to begin, like a project or a hobby, and share it openly. Check back at each new pass to see what is growing.",
"transit:Uranus:Ascendant:hard":"The way you present yourself may feel out of step with who you are becoming, and that gap lasts most of a year over three passes. Others may react to the shift. Update one visible thing about your approach, such as how you speak up in meetings, and explain the change kindly to those who notice. Authenticity settles in gradually.",
"transit:Uranus:Midheaven:conjunction":"Your direction in work and public life is being reshaped over most of a year, with three passes over the point. New paths may appear that the old plan did not include. Update your portfolio or profile, talk to someone in a field you admire, and let your sense of reputation grow beyond the old definition.",
"transit:Uranus:Midheaven:easy":"A more flexible, original approach to your career is available for most of a year, returning twice more. Suggest the new idea at work, or take a side project that shows a different skill. Opportunities may reach you through unconventional contacts, so say yes to a coffee chat. Follow up within a week.",
"transit:Uranus:Midheaven:hard":"Your career path and your wish for independence pull in different directions for most of a year, with the tension repeating over three passes. Routine at work may feel stale or controlled. Describe the change you want in one clear paragraph, then take it to a trusted mentor before acting. Gradual redirection beats a sudden exit.",
"transit:Neptune:Sun:conjunction":"A softer, more dreamy sense of purpose settles over you for one to two years, with three passes over the point. Goals may look hazy before they look clear. Spend time on something creative or quiet each week, and write a loose description of what you want instead of a rigid plan. Clarity grows if you give it room.",
"transit:Neptune:Sun:easy":"Imagination and compassion flow easily through your sense of self over a year or two, and the planet returns twice more. Use the openness for something inspired: music, art, volunteering or a vision you can describe. Set aside one evening a week for it. Gentle, regular practice lets the inspiration take shape.",
"transit:Neptune:Sun:hard":"Your usual confidence may feel less solid for a year or two, with three passes keeping the question alive. Who you are and what you want can seem less certain. Do not force an answer. Keep a short journal, rest properly, and take one small practical step each week. Direction returns through steady habits, not through pressure.",
"transit:Neptune:Moon:conjunction":"Your feelings run deep, soft and very receptive for one to two years, passing the point three times. You may pick up on moods around you more than usual. Build in quiet time alone, near water or music if possible, and keep your sleep regular. Tell people close to you when you need a little space to sort out what is yours.",
"transit:Neptune:Moon:easy":"Tenderness and intuition come easily for a year or two, and the planet returns twice. Home can feel like a refuge. Make one room more restful with softer light or a small ritual, and use your sensitivity to listen to someone who needs it. Easy gifts deepen when you actually practice them.",
"transit:Neptune:Moon:hard":"Emotions can feel foggy or oversized for a year or two, with three passes repeating the theme. It may be hard to tell what you need. Slow down before big replies, and name one feeling at a time out loud or on paper. Keep your routines steady, since regular meals and sleep give your mood a floor.",
"transit:Neptune:Mercury:conjunction":"Your thinking turns imaginative and impressionistic for one to two years, passing the point three times. Facts may feel less sharp while images and hunches grow stronger. Double-check details such as dates and numbers by writing them down. Use the gift for poetry, storytelling or brainstorming, and let a first draft stay loose before editing it.",
"transit:Neptune:Mercury:easy":"Your mind takes in subtle things gracefully for a year or two, with the planet returning twice more. Conversation can carry real empathy. Try a creative writing habit, a listening project or a meditation of ten minutes. Share one story or idea with a friend each week and notice how clearly it shapes up as you tell it.",
"transit:Neptune:Mercury:hard":"Concentration may drift and messages may blur for a year or two, with three passes. This is about attention, not intelligence. Confirm plans in writing, ask a second question when something sounds vague, and keep lists. Take short, clear steps through the day. Plain, simple wording protects you and everyone you talk with.",
"transit:Neptune:Venus:conjunction":"Love and beauty take on a romantic glow for one to two years, with three passes over the point. Ideals about affection run high. Enjoy it through art, music or an evening that feels like a story. Keep one hand on practical matters: talk about money and expectations plainly with a partner, so tenderness rests on shared facts.",
"transit:Neptune:Venus:easy":"Affection feels gentle and imaginative for a year or two, and the planet returns twice. Tenderness comes naturally to you now. Plan something beautiful with someone you care about, such as a quiet dinner by candlelight or a day among music or paintings. Writing a heartfelt note is a good way to use the season.",
"transit:Neptune:Venus:hard":"Romantic ideals and real life may sit a little apart for a year or two, with three passes repeating the question. You may long for something perfect. Appreciate what is actually in front of you, and ask a loved one one honest question about what they want. Keep spending plans simple and written down.",
"transit:Neptune:Mars:conjunction":"Your drive turns softer and more intuitive for one to two years, passing the point three times. Energy may come in waves instead of a steady push. Work in focused blocks with breaks, and attach your effort to something you believe in, such as a cause or a creative craft. A clear weekly goal gives the flow a shape.",
"transit:Neptune:Mars:easy":"Action and imagination cooperate for a year or two, and the planet returns twice more. Give your efforts a purpose beyond yourself: coach someone, help a neighbor, or build a creative piece. Graceful movement such as swimming, dance or yoga suits the mood. Choose one project and take a small step on it daily.",
"transit:Neptune:Mars:hard":"Motivation can feel diffuse for a year or two, with three passes returning the same tug. You may start strong and drift. Break goals into the next small action, and set a visible checkpoint each week. Tell a friend what you are working on so you have a gentle anchor. Rest properly when energy dips.",
"transit:Neptune:Jupiter:conjunction":"Faith and generosity swell and expand for one to two years, passing the point three times. Big hopes feel natural. Give time to something you believe in, such as a spiritual practice or a cause. Turn the vision into a modest first step with a date, and ask a practical friend to look it over.",
"transit:Neptune:Jupiter:easy":"Hope and kindness flow easily for a year or two, with the planet returning twice. Meaning can come through travel, study or service. Join a group that shares an ideal you care about, and offer one specific skill. Easy blessings multiply when you share them, so pass on something you have learned.",
"transit:Neptune:Jupiter:hard":"Optimism can run ahead of the facts for a year or two, with three passes repeating the pattern. Grand pictures are attractive. Measure each idea against a simple question: what is the first step, and what would it cost in time? Keep promises modest, and enjoy the dreaming without handing it your whole schedule.",
"transit:Neptune:Saturn:conjunction":"Solid structures and soft ideals meet at one point for one to two years, with three passes. Rules and responsibilities may feel less clear, and a deeper purpose may start to show through them. Revisit your routines and ask what they are for. Keep one dependable habit while you let the larger picture develop.",
"transit:Neptune:Saturn:easy":"Practicality and vision work well together for a year or two, and the planet returns twice. This is a good stretch for building something that carries meaning, such as a craft, a community role or a long-term plan with heart. Put a small, regular amount of time into it each week and let the structure stay flexible.",
"transit:Neptune:Saturn:hard":"Your sense of duty and your longing for something gentler may pull apart for a year or two, with three passes repeating the tug. Boundaries can feel less firm. Write down your commitments and what each one needs. Keep the ones that still matter, and say a kind, clear no to the rest.",
"transit:Neptune:Ascendant:conjunction":"Your outward presence takes on a soft, hard-to-pin-down quality for one to two years, with three passes over the point. People may read you more impressionistically. Experiment with a style that expresses your inner life, like softer colors or a creative interest, and do not worry if you feel less defined. Ground yourself with daily walks.",
"transit:Neptune:Ascendant:easy":"A gentle, magnetic presence comes naturally for a year or two, and the planet returns twice. Others find you easy to open up to. Start a creative or caring project that shows your sensitivity, and put yourself where such work is welcome. Be present in conversations and listen as much as you speak.",
"transit:Neptune:Ascendant:hard":"How you appear and how you feel inside may not quite match for a year or two, with three passes. You might feel unsure what to show. Take your time and drop the pressure to define yourself. Choose clothes and habits that feel comfortable, and ask a trusted friend how you come across. Clarity arrives gradually.",
"transit:Neptune:Midheaven:conjunction":"Your sense of vocation grows more idealistic over one to two years, with three passes across the point. Career goals may lose their edges while a larger calling comes into view. Describe the work you would find meaningful in a page of plain writing. Then take one practical step, such as a conversation with someone in that field.",
"transit:Neptune:Midheaven:easy":"Creative, caring or visionary work finds support over a year or two, and the planet returns twice more. Your public image can carry warmth. Offer a talent that serves others, like mentoring, design or storytelling, and let it be seen at your workplace. Meeting people who share your ideals helps it grow steadily.",
"transit:Neptune:Midheaven:hard":"Career direction may feel uncertain for a year or two, with three passes returning the question. The old goals may not satisfy, and the new ones are not yet sharp. Do not rush a verdict. Gather information through informal talks, keep your current duties steady, and write a monthly note on what feels meaningful.",
"transit:Pluto:Sun:conjunction":"A year or two of deep renewal sits right on your sense of who you are. Old roles that no longer fit loosen, and a stronger version of you takes shape, usually over three passes as the planet moves forward, back and forward again. Write down what you want to stand for. Then change one habit that does not match it.",
"transit:Pluto:Sun:easy":"Your sense of purpose has strong backing for the next year or two. Deep energy flows toward what matters to you, and it tends to arrive in three waves as the planet repeats its pass. Use it on purpose: pick one long project that expresses who you are and give it steady weekly time. The support is real, but it rewards action.",
"transit:Pluto:Sun:hard":"Pressure to grow into a fuller version of yourself runs for a year or two, often in three rounds. Something in how you see yourself, or how others see you, asks for an honest update. The friction is the engine. Name one role you have outgrown, then take a concrete step toward the one you want next.",
"transit:Pluto:Moon:conjunction":"Your emotional life goes deeper for a year or two, usually in three passes. Feelings you have kept quiet move to the surface and want to be understood, not managed. That can feel intense and also freeing. Give yourself a private ritual, such as a nightly page of honest writing, and let home become a place that restores you.",
"transit:Pluto:Moon:easy":"Feelings run deep but steady for the next year or two, and you can work with them. Comfort comes from being honest about what you need at home and with family. Use the three passes of this period to rearrange something that has long felt off, such as a room, a routine or a conversation you have avoided.",
"transit:Pluto:Moon:hard":"Emotional needs push for attention over a year or two, often returning three times. Old patterns around home, family or comfort can feel tugged from both sides. Treat it as a clean-out. Notice what you cling to out of habit, say one need out loud, and make one change at home that supports you.",
"transit:Pluto:Mercury:conjunction":"Your thinking goes deeper for a year or two. Questions you used to skim now want real digging, and conversations lean toward the honest and the serious. Over the three passes, your mind can reshape a long-held belief. Pick one subject and study it properly, or have the candid talk you have been rehearsing.",
"transit:Pluto:Mercury:easy":"Your mind finds depth easily for the next year or two. Research, interviews and honest conversations go further than usual, and you read between the lines well. Use the three passes to dig into a topic you care about. Start a notebook of what you learn, and ask the question underneath the question.",
"transit:Pluto:Mercury:hard":"Your thinking is pushed to go deeper over a year or two, often in three rounds. Fixed ideas get challenged, and talks with others can turn into tests of will. Treat it as training in honest speech. Listen before replying, say the plain version of what you mean, and revisit one opinion you have held without checking.",
"transit:Pluto:Venus:conjunction":"What you love and value gets a thorough renewal across a year or two, usually in three passes. Attachments become more honest and more intense. Ask what you truly want from closeness, and what your money habits say about your values. Choose one relationship or spending habit and look at it plainly, without hurry.",
"transit:Pluto:Venus:easy":"Affection and values deepen in a good way for a year or two. You can be more honest with people you love, and you tend to sense what is worth keeping. Over the three passes, spend your attention generously: plan one unhurried evening with someone close, and say something real instead of something polite.",
"transit:Pluto:Venus:hard":"Love and values face a thorough test over a year or two, often in three rounds. Possessiveness, old patterns or mismatched wants can come up and ask to be named. That is the work, and it can lead to closeness that is truer. Say one honest thing about what you need, and listen closely to the reply.",
"transit:Pluto:Mars:conjunction":"Your drive carries serious force for a year or two. Anger, desire and ambition all run hotter and want a worthy target. Over the three passes, aim that force at one demanding goal, and give your body a regular outlet such as a long walk or a workout. Pause a day before sending any heated message.",
"transit:Pluto:Mars:easy":"Stamina and willpower are well supported for the next year or two. You can push through what usually stalls you, and you tend to know where your energy should go. Use the three passes to finish something big. Break it into weekly pieces, and protect the time for each one.",
"transit:Pluto:Mars:hard":"Your drive meets resistance over a year or two, often in three rounds. Frustration, power struggles and impatience can show you where your energy has been scattered. Channel it: choose one effort worth the fight, train for something physical, and wait a day before replying when you are angry.",
"transit:Pluto:Jupiter:conjunction":"Your sense of growth and belief deepens for a year or two. Large hopes get tested against what is real, and the ones that survive can feel solid. Across three passes, look at what you truly believe and where you are generous. Choose one big goal, and write out the first three steps toward it.",
"transit:Pluto:Jupiter:easy":"Faith and opportunity run deep for the next year or two. Your sense of what is worth pursuing is strong, and others can feel your conviction. Use the three passes to expand something meaningful: join a course, offer to mentor someone, or finish the proposal you have been sitting on.",
"transit:Pluto:Jupiter:hard":"Beliefs and ambitions are pushed to mature over a year or two, often in three rounds. Overconfidence or overreach can show where you have stretched too far. Treat it as a reset. Trim a commitment that has grown too big, and rework one plan so that it fits your real time and energy.",
"transit:Pluto:Saturn:conjunction":"Structure and responsibility get rebuilt across a year or two. Rules and routines you leaned on are examined, and the strong ones get stronger. Over three passes, you can lay a firmer foundation. Pick one commitment that matters, and make it sturdier with a clear schedule and a realistic limit.",
"transit:Pluto:Saturn:easy":"Discipline and depth combine for the next year or two. You can restructure how you work with less strain than usual, and steady effort pays off. Use the three passes to rebuild one system that has grown messy, whether that is a filing method, a weekly plan or a training routine.",
"transit:Pluto:Saturn:hard":"Limits and pressure push you to rebuild how you carry responsibility across a year or two, usually in three rounds. Old structures that no longer fit feel heavy, and that is a call to renew them. List what you carry, hand one item back or delegate it, and tighten one boundary.",
"transit:Pluto:Ascendant:conjunction":"Your image and your approach to the world are renewed over a year or two. People may notice you seem more intense or more focused, and you may want a fresh look or a new start. Over three passes, shape it deliberately. Change one visible thing, such as your style or the way you introduce yourself.",
"transit:Pluto:Ascendant:easy":"Reinventing how you present yourself comes easily for the next year or two. A new look, a new tone or a fresh start fits well, and you carry more presence. Use the three passes to try something: update your photo, rewrite your intro, or begin the thing you have been circling.",
"transit:Pluto:Ascendant:hard":"Pressure to change how you show up runs for a year or two, often in three rounds. The way you come across may clash with who you are becoming, and others may react. Treat it as a rebuild. Drop one habit of self-presentation that feels like a mask, and try a more direct way to introduce yourself.",
"transit:Pluto:Midheaven:conjunction":"Career and public direction are transformed over a year or two. Your role may deepen, change shape or gain weight. Over three passes, the question is what you want to be known for. Write a clear paragraph about it, and take one step toward it, such as asking a senior colleague for a conversation.",
"transit:Pluto:Midheaven:easy":"Support for career reinvention runs for the next year or two. Your reputation can deepen, and responsibility suits you. Use the three passes actively: ask for the bigger project, speak to someone whose work you respect, or update your portfolio with what you do best.",
"transit:Pluto:Midheaven:hard":"Your direction and public role are pushed to change over a year or two, often in three rounds. Work that once fit can feel too small or tangled in power dynamics. It is a renewal. Clarify what you want to be known for, and have one honest conversation about your role.",
"moonhouse:1":"Today's mood turns toward you. For two or three days you feel your own needs more clearly, and your face and body show it. Fresh starts feel natural. Do one small thing for yourself first, such as a walk or an early start, before you answer anyone else's requests.",
"moonhouse:2":"Comfort and money matters sit in the foreground for a couple of days. You notice what you own, what you value and what feels secure. Check one small thing: look over your spending for the week, or tidy a drawer of things you rarely use. Treat yourself modestly.",
"moonhouse:3":"Your mind and tongue feel light for two or three days. Messages, short errands and chats with siblings or neighbors take center stage, and curiosity is up. Reply to the message you have been putting off, take a route you do not usually take, or read something new for ten minutes.",
"moonhouse:4":"Feelings turn homeward for a day or two. You may want quiet, familiar food and your own space, and family or roots may come up in conversation. Stay in if you can. Cook something simple, call a relative, or rearrange one corner so that it feels more like yours.",
"moonhouse:5":"A playful, warm mood settles in for two or three days. Creativity, romance and fun feel closer, and you want to enjoy yourself. Make room for it. Sketch, dance in the kitchen, plan a date, or play a game with friends, and let it be unproductive on purpose.",
"moonhouse:6":"Practical, tidy energy runs through the next two or three days. You notice what in your routine is clumsy and want to fix it. Work and daily habits get your attention. Pick one small system to improve, such as a morning checklist, a cleaner desk or a simpler lunch plan.",
"moonhouse:7":"Attention turns toward others for two or three days. One-to-one conversations matter, and you notice how you and a partner or close friend meet each other. Keep it cooperative. Check in with one person, listen fully, and ask a real question before offering your view.",
"moonhouse:8":"A deeper, more private mood arrives for a couple of days. Trust, shared money and closeness are on your mind, and you may want to release something you no longer need. Be honest with someone close about what you want, or go through one shared bill or a stack of old papers.",
"moonhouse:9":"Your outlook widens for two or three days. You want the bigger picture, and travel, study and large questions look appealing. Follow the curiosity. Plan a day trip, start an article or lecture far from your usual field, or talk philosophy with a friend over coffee.",
"moonhouse:10":"Ambition and visibility are higher for a couple of days. You feel the pull to achieve and to be seen doing it well, and work takes center stage. Do the most important task first, then send the update or ask the question that moves your goals forward.",
"moonhouse:11":"Friends, groups and hopes call to you for two or three days. You may want company and shared plans, and good ideas come up in conversation. Reach out. Message a friend you have not seen lately, join an event, or tell someone about one hope you hold for the year.",
"moonhouse:12":"A quiet, inward mood settles in for two or three days. You need rest, solitude and a slower pace, and feelings float up on their own. Allow it. Go to bed a little earlier, take a walk without headphones, or sit with a notebook and write down whatever comes.",
"sunhouse:1":"The spotlight is on you for about a month. Your energy, your appearance and your sense of direction get a boost, and it is a good season to start fresh. Decide what you want the coming year to look like, then take one visible step: a new routine, a new look, or a first move on something you have postponed.",
"sunhouse:2":"Money, possessions and self-worth are the focus for the next month. You notice what you have and what you want to build, which makes it a good time for an honest review. List your regular expenses, pick one thing to simplify, and write down what you bring to your work that deserves to be valued.",
"sunhouse:3":"Talk, learning and local life are in the spotlight for about a month. Your mind is quick and you have more to say. Siblings, neighbors and short trips come up. Start the course, write the post, or visit the nearby place you keep skipping, and carry a notebook, since ideas arrive on the move.",
"sunhouse:4":"Home and family draw the light for a month. You are pulled toward roots, privacy and the places where you feel safe, so make that space work for you. Clear a room, host a quiet dinner, or call a relative you have missed. Time spent at home counts as real progress this season.",
"sunhouse:5":"Creativity, romance and play are lit up for a month. You want to enjoy yourself and be seen at your best, so say yes to fun that feels meaningful. Start a creative project with a small weekly time slot, plan something romantic, or spend an afternoon with children or good-humored friends.",
"sunhouse:6":"Daily work, routines and habits take the focus for about a month. You can spot what wears on your schedule, and you have the patience to fix it. Rebuild one routine, such as your morning start or a weekly plan, and tidy the tools you use every day. Helping a colleague counts as progress too.",
"sunhouse:7":"Partnerships step forward for a month. One-to-one bonds, whether romantic, work or friendship, shape your days, and you see yourself through other people's eyes. Practice give and take. Ask a partner what they need, say what you need in return, and finish a joint plan you left half done. Small acts of fairness count most.",
"sunhouse:8":"Shared resources and intimacy are the focus for about a month. Trust, joint money and what you give to others come up for review. Look at what you share and what you hold back. Go over a shared budget or agreement, have an honest talk about closeness, and let go of one thing you no longer need.",
"sunhouse:9":"Your horizon widens for a month. Travel, study, beliefs and big ideas call, and it is a good season to learn something that stretches you. Plan a trip, enroll in a class, read a thinker you tend to disagree with, or write down what you actually believe about one large question.",
"sunhouse:10":"Career and public role take center stage for about a month. Your goals are clear and others notice your work. Aim high with a plan. Define the one result you want this season, ask for the meeting, update your resume or portfolio, and take the visible lead on a project.",
"sunhouse:11":"Friends, groups and hopes are in focus for a month. You are drawn to community and to people who share your goals, so reach out. Join a group, organize a gathering, or tell a friend about a long-term hope. Working alongside others takes you further than going alone this season.",
"sunhouse:12":"A quieter month begins, centered on rest, reflection and the unseen. The year behind you comes into focus before a new cycle starts. Slow down. Keep a few evenings free, write about what you have learned, spend time alone outdoors, or volunteer quietly. Rest now makes the next stretch easier.",
"retro:Mercury":"For about three weeks, a few times a year, the mind loops back. Messages, plans and errands benefit from a second look. Double-check dates, addresses and what you wrote before you send it. It is a good time for the re- words: reread, redo, reconnect with someone from the past. Back up your files, and hold new launches until it passes.",
"retro:Venus":"For around six weeks every year and a half, love and values turn inward. Old relationships and tastes resurface for a second look. Ask what you truly want from pleasure and from closeness. Revisit a spending habit, reconnect with an old friend, or finish a creative piece, and hold off on dramatic style changes until it passes.",
"retro:Mars":"For two to three months every two years, your drive slows and turns back. Energy works better on review than on a push. Revisit stalled projects, improve your methods, and rest well. Think over how you handle anger and how you start things, and finish what is half done before you begin another.",
"retro:Jupiter":"For about four months each year, growth turns inward. Instead of expanding, you refine what you believe and what you have already started. Revisit your goals, check which opportunities truly fit, and appreciate what already works. Study a subject more deeply, or rework a plan that grew too fast. Generosity can start closer to home.",
"retro:Saturn":"For about four and a half months a year, structure asks for review. Look at routines, commitments and long-term goals, and test whether they still hold. Tighten what works and repair what does not. Redo a schedule, revisit a deadline, and finish an overdue task. The work done now makes your foundations sturdier.",
"retro:Uranus":"For about five months a year, change moves inward. Instead of shaking things up, you reconsider what freedom means to you. Revisit a past decision about independence, and notice which changes you started and which you only wished for. Try one small, deliberate experiment in your routine, and review what stirred earlier in the year.",
"retro:Neptune":"For about five months a year, the fog thins and you see more clearly. Dreams, ideals and compassion get a second look. Revisit what you hoped for and ask what is real. Spend time on art, music or quiet reflection, and review where you gave too much of yourself. Redo one fuzzy plan with specifics.",
"retro:Pluto":"For about five months a year, deep change slows and turns inward. Instead of pushing for transformation, you review what has already been shifting. Revisit habits, power dynamics and old patterns, and ask what is ready for renewal. Reflect in writing, and clear out what you keep only from habit."};
